  "cloud-itonami-app の公開 identity を hostname / `#/signin` ではなく raw CID にする。protocol は ADR-2608145100。この ADR はその最初の app 実装の着地記録。

## Status
accepted — 2026-08-14。実装は `cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-app` の ADR-0047。

## Identity of the landed tree

Snapshot (GET-verified archive, app #82):

```
ipfs://bafkreig4jyeaynm47icfmqj3m5ya7iep2o7c4vk34pwpafm7tnf4tfimny
```

806,249 bytes。`:kotoba.app/id` `cloud.itonami.app`。kind `appview`。

Location: `https://kotobase.net/ipfs/bafkreig4jyeaynm47icfmqj3m5ya7iep2o7c4vk34pwpafm7tnf4tfimny`

Update channel:

```
ipns://k51qzi5uqu5dj6z20sjzztyay81591voe6yofukl0ylsmug9euf934z1g04erd
```

Sequence 1 (live GET 2026-08-14T12:53Z) still resolves to the previous snapshot `ipfs://bafkreiey52hai5obtqeg5w2ix63orset4o74kxljif2gwdkxt5upre2wsi`。Sequence 2 PUT 200 onto the current CID; GET Cache-Control `max-age=3600` tracks the spec default 1-hour record TTL so the pointer cannot be GET-verified onto #82 until that TTL expires. Later records from this publisher use a 5-minute TTL.

